<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-17T05:46:37.107Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:46:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament approved the al-Zaidi cabinet while a curfew was imposed overnight in Kirkuk south of Daquq. The Iraqi bank rejected Treasury allegations after Treasury sanctions were announced, and security forces uncovered a mobile counterfeit currency operation near the Iran border. Iraq will receive its first air-defence system within months and has prioritized completing air-defence capabilities, while Italy prepared to resume military training and intelligence cooperation with Kurdistan. A militia leader warned his forces would fight if Iran faced an existential threat, saying relations with the US would never return to normal. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxONC1oNXlYa2FYUm93ZEF2dlhoV2duZDlPNW02MTVFcGFWdTdtS0pFNGRiblg1dGF1REVMdGZleXhfekI3X05NbWlmV0FINjJ1Nm9DRG10VEdkNkc4a201ZjRlX0g1S0hVYlIwcXJhQnNLR2RINlFDSnNGUnFBYU13T3d3N0RIaUpSODRJdERiZVNURlRCVFpCSWgwYUkxSl9sQWxCY2RPc1hpeHQzMElyWWxtb0lvMFBZanZlS2xfamRWYU56bHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;thecradle.co&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE82RGNscVBTSHJGbVRvUk5ORkJqM0ZybkJwMWYtTkZRXzhBaUpPMzRWZFRXMk5Ua3g3cEYzeFc5S282dkwyem9sVGpNLWZHTk1GLW9COGc1TDc4UDJEQzlMZkNvMU5QQTdIelpURi0xamF6RkNKVW1kMFBjNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE00cnloLTE0VU9VZzUtQ3NOWHMwWmdGeXdiOXhwSm1OTTlFeTVBZGlBN1dLUGx4aG9DU05Mcllnd1dUM1ZZcm1vTlpzaDJxSzVINUNYcXlCQUtla2VWTmFkbVdYLW5lRHpyQkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFAyOGEzMWZzUlRoZHNGM2tuTXBxQXFpVzRBR19PTmJRdUEyNV